{"id":"645665","name":"客家年糕","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/645665/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材：糯米粉、红糖块、姜片。","img":"images/645665/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红糖切碎。","img":"images/645665/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小锅里放入适量的水，加入姜片。","img":"images/645665/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开熬出姜味后，倒入红糖。","img":"images/645665/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把红糖化开。","img":"images/645665/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出姜片。","img":"images/645665/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把红糖水趁热倒入糯米粉中。","img":"images/645665/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"用力搅拌。","img":"images/645665/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌成无颗粒又细腻的面糊。","img":"images/645665/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取两个铝箔烤盘，盘里刷油。","img":"images/645665/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"面糊倒入盘内，震出气泡。","img":"images/645665/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"入蒸锅。","img":"images/645665/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"时间40~45分钟。","img":"images/645665/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"时间到出锅。","img":"images/645665/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放置一两个小时后脱模。","img":"images/645665/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"切成块（可食用）。","img":"images/645665/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放平底锅煎至两面起酥再食用，味道更棒。","img":"images/645665/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}